aking winged lizard named Vyrn lived in Zinkenstill, an island which yields mysteries. One day, they come across a girl named Lyria.\nLyria had escaped from the Erste Empire, a military government that is trying to rule over this world using powerful military prowess.\nGran and Lyria, in order to escape from the Empire, head out into the vast skies, holding the letter Gran's father left behind - which said, \"I will be waiting at Estalucia, Island of the Astrals\".\n\nNote: The first two episodes premiered on January 21st as a special."},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aviation","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ships","rank":26,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Granblue Fantasy: The Animation","english":"Granblue Fantasy: The Animation","native":"GRANBLUE FANTASY The Animation","romaji":"GRANBLUE FANTASY The Animation","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"碧蓝幻想"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"グランブルーファンタジー"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"GRANBLUE FANTASY"}]},"trailer":{"id":"u_q9-hQUC6w","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u_q9-hQUC6w/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}